<title>LEBANON: Lebanese CPI rises 9.3 pct in Jan-Oct - Banks Assn.</title>
<headline>Lebanese CPI rises 9.3 pct in Jan-Oct - Banks Assn.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanese consumer prices rose 9.3 percent in the first 10 months of the year, according to figures issued by the Lebanese Banks Association.</p>
<p> LEBANESE CPI	Dec 95  Aug 96  Sep 96  Oct 96  Dec95-Oct96</p>
<p>Index (base Dec 1994=100)</p>
<p>			 111.24  121.07  123.00  121.58	9.30 pct</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (961 1) 864148 602057 353078 645456</p>
</text>
